$DATUM [0307] (Example 25) Method for producing (R)-1-benzoyl-3-aminopiperidine
[0309] Sodium hydroxide (7.4 g, 2 equivalents) and sodium hypochlorite
(64.0 g, 1.1 equivalents) were added to the aqueous solution of
(R)-1-benzoyl nipecotamide obtained in the method described in Example 10
(amount: 210 g, net weight: 20.8 g). The mixture was stirred at 25 °C for
6 hours to obtain a solution (280.90 g) containing the title compound
(17.7 g, yield: 97%).
