$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM [0019] Example 3 Under an argon atmosphere, dimethylformamide (1ml) to
(2S, 3S)-2-benzyl-3,4-dihydroxy-butyl amide (0.113g, 0.54mmol),
N-bromosuccinimide (0.125g, 0.702mmol), Potassium acetate (0.063g,
0.648mmol) successively added at room temperature, and the mixture was
stirred for 2 hours. After completion of the reaction dimethyl formamide
was evaporated, the residue extract with ethyl acetate, water the organic
layer was washed with brine, After drying with magnesium sulfate was
concentrated under reduced pressure. The residue purified by silica gel
chromatography (4S,5S)-4-benzyl-5-hydroxymethyl oxazolidine-2-on (79mg,
71%) was obtained.
