$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM t,t-2,6-Diacetoxy-r-1-tert-butoxycarbonylaminio-1-cyanocyclohexane (3a):
Pb(OAc)4 (20 g) was added to a solution of 2b (2.5 g, 9.32 mmol) in
t-BuOH/DMF (40:10mL). The mixture was stirred and boiled under reflux for
40 min, and then cooled. Toluene (100 mL) and Et2O (50 mL) were added and
the solution was filtered, washed with H2O (2 x 50 mL), dried (Na2SO4)
and concentrated. The crude was purified by column chromatography
(Et2O/hexane, 5:1) to give 3a. Yield 1.9 g, 64%. mp 170-172°C. C11H24N2O6
(340.4), calc. found: C 56.46, 56.34 , H 7.11,7.12 N 8.23, 8.10; IR: ν =
3249, 3145, 1752, 1698 cm-1. 1H NMR (CDCI3/TMS): δ = 2.05-1.38 [m, 6H,
(CH2)3], 2.10 (s, 6H, 2 Ac), 4.95 (br s, 1 H, NH), 5.29 (dd, 2H, J =
11.5, 4.4 Hz, H-2,6). 13C NMR (CDCl3/TMS): δ = 19.19 (C-4), 21.0 (2
CH3CO), 28.2 [(CH3)3C], 28.5 (C-3,5), 62.4 (C-1), 72.1 (C-2,6), 81.5
(Me3C), 114.7 (CN), 153.0 (CONH), 170.1 (2CO).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
